runk (155.5 m, at grade; the 1922 street crossed the B&O at grade) to the old canal bank. Roadway at least 162.3 m over the trunk: about 3.5% up from Knowlton's Corner (149.4 m) along Dodsworth, then about 2% to the bank (163-166 m)<br>structure: viaduct<br>edited: true]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.5376126,39.1570116,0 -84.5378161,39.1564537,0 -84.5379875,39.1561519,0 -84.5381154,39.1558357,0 -84.5382053,39.1554158,0 -84.5382766,39.154974,0 -84.5382584,39.1545272,0 -84.5381395,39.1540748,0 -84.5380034,39.1538166,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ludlow Avenue</name><description><![CDATA[layer: street<br>id: S22016<br>name: Ludlow Avenue<br>kind: we_street<br>width_m: 18.29<br>width_ft: 60<br>width_src: printed (1922)<br>side: <br>src: Sanborn 1922<br>sheets: 22-37R<br>geom_src: 1922 Sanborn intersections<br>set: 1922<br>note: at grade from the old canal bank over the canal bed, past Central Parkway (167.7 m) to Lafayette Avenue (160.4 m); the Lafayette junction agrees with the 1912 survey corner within 25 m<br>edited: false]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.5380034,39.1538166,0 -84.5379458,39.1537072,0 -84.5376758,39.1534424,0 -84.5372432,39.1532398,0 -84.5365866,39.1530243,0 -84.5361509,39.1528572,0 -84.5354385,39.1524247,0 -84.5346366,39.1518018,0 -84.5331452,39.1502412,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>State Avenue</name><description><![CDATA[layer: street<br>id: LPH000<br>name: State Avenue<br>kind: we_street<br>width_m: 18.29<br>width_ft: 60<br>width_src: printed<br>side: <br>src: Sanborn 1904<br>sheets: 461, 462, 466<br>geom_src: Sanborn intersections (vol. 5, Lower Price Hill spline); crossings moved along it (up to 11.2 m)<br>set: lph<br>edited: false]]></description><styleUrl>#tee</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-84.554148,39.1018211,0 -84.5541072,39.102333